OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto is back with another week
OL,7,     Fof the best in jazz from the UK
OL,8,     Fand around the world, and he
OL,9,     Fwelcomes his Flowers guest this
OL,10,     Fweek, saxophonist and woodwind
OL,11,     Fplayer Tamar Osborn.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FLahav Shani conducts La Scala
OL,14,     FPhilharmonic Orchestra in
OL,15,     FMendelssohn's Violin Concerto in E
OL,16,     Fminor, joined by violinist Joshua
OL,17,     FBell. We then hear Dvorak's
OL,18,     Fintense Symphony No 9.
